                                                   <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "x process_starts y iff x and y are instances of processes, and x is_cause_of y, and i is an instance of a temporal instant, and r is an instance of a temporal interval, and y has starting instance i, and x occupies temporal region r, and r has inside instant i."@en ;
